<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Example of GPT-5 failure in code/text decision</h2>

<figure id="A1.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.01279v1/GPT-5-fail.png" id="A1.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:452/272;" width="452" height="272" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="A1.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example of GPT-5 failure in code/text decision. In this case, the question is incorrectly solved with textual reasoning (a) but can be easily addressed through code generation (c). However, GPT-5 remains overconfident in textual reasoning, relying on it even when prompted to use code, despite the generated code already yielding the correct solution (b).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithm of TUMIX</h2>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> TUMIX: Multi-Agent Test-Time Scaling (answers only)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          question <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math>; agent pool <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}=\{s_{1},\dots,s_{K}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}=\{s_{1},\dots,s_{K}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> 15 pre-designed agents (Code / Search / Dual-Tool variants)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          minimum rounds <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{\min}=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{\min}=2</annotation></semantics></math>; maximum rounds <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>; tool-interaction budget <math id="alg1.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{tool}}=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tool</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{tool}}=5</annotation></semantics></math>; code time limit <math id="alg1.l2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=60</annotation></semantics></math>s

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{A}_{0}\leftarrow\varnothing" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}_{0}\leftarrow\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> answers from prior rounds
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=1,2,\dots,r_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=1,2,\dots,r_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Round-<math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> message passing: each agent reads <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> + prior answers</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">parallel for</span> each <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> 

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{r}^{s}\leftarrow\textsc{BuildPrompt}(q,\mathcal{A}_{r-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">BuildPrompt</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{r}^{s}\leftarrow\textsc{BuildPrompt}(q,\mathcal{A}_{r-1})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> concatenate <math id="alg1.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> with all answers from prior round
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{r}^{s}\leftarrow\textsc{AgentCall}(s,p_{r}^{s},R_{\text{tool}},\tau)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentCall</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tool</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{r}^{s}\leftarrow\textsc{AgentCall}(s,p_{r}^{s},R_{\text{tool}},\tau)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> tool-augmented reasoning (Alg. <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Appendix B Algorithm of TUMIX ‣ TUMIX: Multi-Agent Test-Time Scaling with Tool-Use Mixture" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{A}_{r}\leftarrow\{y_{r}^{s}:s\in\mathcal{S}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}_{r}\leftarrow\{y_{r}^{s}:s\in\mathcal{S}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\geq r_{\min}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\geq r_{\min}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <span id="alg1.l10.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LLMTerminate<math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(q,\mathcal{A}_{r})=\text{STOP}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>STOP</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(q,\mathcal{A}_{r})=\text{STOP}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span id="alg1.l10.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> 

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{\star}\leftarrow\textsc{MajorityVote}(\mathcal{A}_{r})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">MajorityVote</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{\star}\leftarrow\textsc{MajorityVote}(\mathcal{A}_{r})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> <span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentCall<math id="alg2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,p,R_{\text{tool}},\tau)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tool</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,p,R_{\text{tool}},\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span>: tool-augmented reasoning for agent <math id="alg2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> (returns answer only)</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\leftarrow p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\leftarrow p</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg2.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> is the running context; <math id="alg2.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> counts tool interactions
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b&lt;R_{\text{tool}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>tool</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b&lt;R_{\text{tool}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
