            <span id="alg2.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>o</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o</annotation></semantics></math> contains a final answer <math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
