            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E\leftarrow\textsc{WebSearch}(o)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">WebSearch</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E\leftarrow\textsc{WebSearch}(o)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l14.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> supports <span id="alg2.l14.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gs</span>/<span id="alg2.l14.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">llm</span>/<span id="alg2.l14.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">com</span> variants
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="h\leftarrow h\parallel\text{``Retrieved evidence:'' }E" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mtext>“Retrieved evidence:” </mtext><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\leftarrow h\parallel\text{``Retrieved evidence:'' }E</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg2.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\leftarrow b+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\leftarrow b+1</annotation></semantics></math>; <span id="alg2.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">continue</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\leftarrow h\parallel\text{``Continue reasoning with current context.''}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo><mtext>“Continue reasoning with current context.”</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\leftarrow h\parallel\text{``Continue reasoning with current context.''}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l17.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> encourage self-reflection
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">20:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o\leftarrow\textsc{LLMGenerate}(s,h)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">LLMGenerate</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o\leftarrow\textsc{LLMGenerate}(s,h)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l20.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> budget exhausted; force a decision
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">21:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>o</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
